# OmniCart Cursor Instructions

Before writing or editing code in this repository, you must read and adhere to:
1. `AGENTS.md` (root) - Master guidance and **Skill Loading Policy**.
2. `.agents/rules/RULE.md` - Domain guardrails, privacy, and evidence grounding.
3. `.agents/rules/command-whitelist.md` - Command and file-operation policy (enforced via `.cursor/cli.json`).

Do NOT duplicate or copy skills into `.cursor/` or elsewhere. Consult skills on demand directly from `.agents/skills/` as specified in `AGENTS.md`.
